  "text": " Just an infringement on our medical freedom. This is an infringement on our Kapuna's health. I mean, no one's looking after the health of our Kapuna. You know, I've seen more death come from the vaccine. 32 Kapuna, immediately after taking the Moderna shot, either the first or second shot, passed away from this. So who's looking out for their care? The people that try to speak up and look out for their care? It falls on deaf ears. No one corresponds back with us. No one wants to hear it because it doesn't fit the current narrative. It's horrible. And I think it's just going to continue to get worse. You know, my advice to people, I work in a skilled nursing facility. And my advice to people is if your Kapuna are sick, if your elderly are sick, your grandmother, your great-grandmother, your mom, don't send them to a skilled nursing facility. They're not going to receive adequate care. Treatment is going to be withheld from them. They're going to be forced to wear a mask all day in social distance. They're going to become depressed and want to commit suicide because that's what I'm seeing in our facilities. That's what's been going on.",
